msgstr "Tienes un mensaje nuevo:"

msgid "View Messages"
msgstr "Ver mis mensajes"

#, python-format
msgid "New message from %(sender)s"
msgstr "Mensaje nuevo de %(sender)s"

msgid "URGENT"
msgstr "URGENTE"

msgid "IMPORTANT"
msgstr "IMPORTANTE"

#, python-format
msgid "New Announcement - %(garden)s"
msgstr "Nuevo anuncio - %(garden)s"

msgid "View Garden"
msgstr "Ver el huerto"

msgid "You're on the Waitlist!"
msgstr "¡Estás en la lista de espera!"

#, python-format
msgid "You have been added to the waitlist for <strong>%(garden)s</strong>."
msgstr "Te anotamos en la lista de espera de <strong>%(garden)s</strong>."

msgid ""
"We will let you know as soon as a plot becomes available. In the "
"meantime, feel free to explore the garden's events and community "
"features."
msgstr ""
"Te avisaremos en cuanto se desocupe una parcela. Mientras tanto, puedes "
"ver los eventos y la comunidad del huerto."

msgid "Browse Gardens"
msgstr "Ver huertos"

#, python-format
msgid "Waitlist Confirmation for %(garden)s"
msgstr "Confirmación de la lista de espera de %(garden)s"

msgid "Your Box is Ready!"
msgstr "¡Tu caja está lista!"

#, python-format
msgid "A new box preview has been published for <strong>%(plan)s</strong>."
msgstr "Se publicó el adelanto de una caja nueva de <strong>%(plan)s</strong>."

msgid "What's in the box:"
msgstr "Qué trae la caja:"

msgid "View Subscription"
msgstr "Ver mi suscripción"

#, python-format
msgid "New Box Preview for %(plan)s"
msgstr "Adelanto de caja nueva de %(plan)s"

#, python-format
msgid "%(num)s grower"
msgid_plural "%(num)s growers"
msgstr[0] "%(num)s productor"
msgstr[1] "%(num)s productores"

#, python-format
msgid "%(category)s Harvest Alert!"
msgstr "¡Aviso de cosecha de %(category)s!"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Great news! <strong>%(category)s</strong> harvests are coming in from "
"<strong>%(growers)s</strong> in your community."
msgstr ""
"¡Buenas noticias! Ya está entrando la cosecha de "
"<strong>%(category)s</strong> de <strong>%(growers)s</strong> en tu "
"comunidad."

msgid ""
"Check the Harvest Forecast to see estimated quantities, timing, and "
"connect with growers who have produce available."
msgstr ""
"Consulta el Pronóstico de cosecha para ver cantidades estimadas, fechas y"
" contactar a quienes tienen producto disponible."

msgid "View Harvest Forecast"
msgstr "Ver el pronóstico de cosecha"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"You're receiving this because you subscribed to %(category)s harvest "
"alerts."
msgstr ""
"Recibes este correo porque te suscribiste a los avisos de cosecha de "
"%(category)s."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Visit your <a href=\"%(url)s\">Harvest Forecast</a> to manage your "
"notification preferences."
msgstr ""
"Entra a tu <a href=\"%(url)s\">Pronóstico de cosecha</a> para cambiar tus"
" preferencias de avisos."

#, python-format
msgid "%(category)s Harvest Alert"
msgstr "Aviso de cosecha de %(category)s"

msgid "Welcome to YardHarvest Garden Management"
msgstr "Bienvenido a la administración de huertos de YardHarvest"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your %(days)s-day trial of Garden Pro for <strong>%(garden)s</strong> is "
"now active."
msgstr ""
"Tu prueba de %(days)s días de Garden Pro para <strong>%(garden)s</strong>"
" ya está activa."

msgid "Here's how to make the most of your first week:"
msgstr "Así puedes aprovechar tu primera semana:"

msgid "Add your plots"
msgstr "Agrega tus parcelas"

msgid "Set up your garden layout and assign members to their plots"
msgstr "Arma el plano del huerto y asigna a cada integrante su parcela"

msgid "Invite your members"
msgstr "Invita a tus integrantes"

msgid "Share your garden link so members can join"
msgstr "Comparte el enlace de tu huerto para que puedan unirse"

msgid "Set up dues"
msgstr "Configura las cuotas"

msgid "Configure your seasonal plot fees and generate invoices with one click"
msgstr "Define las cuotas de la temporada y genera los recibos con un clic"

msgid "Schedule your first workday"
msgstr "Agenda tu primera jornada de trabajo"

msgid "Create a volunteer shift and let members sign up"
msgstr "Crea un turno de voluntariado y deja que se apunten"

msgid "Go to Garden Dashboard"
msgstr "Ir al panel del huerto"

msgid ""
"Your trial includes everything: financial management, volunteer tracking,"
" photo wall, broadcast messaging, custom email branding, and more."
msgstr ""
"Tu prueba incluye todo: administración financiera, seguimiento de "
"voluntariado, muro de fotos, mensajes masivos, correos con tu propia "
"marca y más."

msgid "Questions? Reply to this email — we read every one."
msgstr "¿Dudas? Responde a este correo: los leemos todos."

msgid ""
"Getting started is easy — add your first plot in under a minute from the "
"Garden Dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Empezar es fácil: agrega tu primera parcela en menos de un minuto desde "
"el panel del huerto."

msgid "Your members can join by visiting your garden page:"
msgstr "Tus integrantes pueden unirse desde la página de tu huerto:"

#, python-format
msgid "How is %(garden)s coming along?"
msgstr "¿Cómo va %(garden)s?"

msgid "You've been on YardHarvest for 3 days. Here's what you've set up so far:"
msgstr "Llevas 3 días en YardHarvest. Esto es lo que has configurado:"

msgid "Plots configured"
msgstr "Parcelas configuradas"

msgid "Members joined"
msgstr "Integrantes que se unieron"

msgid "Events scheduled"
msgstr "Eventos agendados"

msgid "Continue Setting Up"
msgstr "Seguir configurando"

#, python-format
msgid "%(num)s day left in your trial."
msgid_plural "%(num)s days left in your trial."
msgstr[0] "Queda %(num)s día de prueba."
msgstr[1] "Quedan %(num)s días de prueba."

msgid "You're halfway through your trial"
msgstr "Vas a la mitad de tu periodo de prueba"

msgid "One week in! Here are the Pro features that save organizers the most time:"
msgstr ""
"¡Ya pasó una semana! Estas son las funciones de Pro que más tiempo le "
"ahorran a un organizador:"

msgid "Financial Management"
msgstr "Administración financiera"

msgid ""
"Generate dues for every member in one click. Track expenses by category. "
"Send payment reminders automatically."
msgstr ""
"Genera las cuotas de todos con un clic. Registra gastos por categoría. "
"Envía recordatorios de pago automáticos."

msgid "Try Financial Tools"
msgstr "Probar las herramientas financieras"

msgid "Volunteer Shifts"
msgstr "Turnos de voluntariado"

msgid ""
"Create workday shifts, track who shows up, and generate volunteer hour "
"reports for grant applications."
msgstr ""
"Crea turnos de trabajo, registra quién asiste y genera reportes de horas "
"de voluntariado para solicitudes de financiamiento."

msgid "Broadcast Messaging"
msgstr "Mensajes masivos"

msgid ""
"Send announcements to every member via email and in-app notification — no"
" more group text chains."
msgstr ""
"Envía anuncios a todos por correo y notificación en la app: se acabaron "
"las cadenas de mensajes."

msgid "soon"
msgstr "pronto"

#, python-format
msgid "(save %(amount)s)"
msgstr "(ahorras %(amount)s)"

#, python-format
msgid "Your %(garden)s trial ends in 2 days"
msgstr "Tu prueba de %(garden)s termina en 2 días"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your Garden Pro trial ends on <strong>%(date)s</strong>. Here's what "
"happens:"
msgstr ""
"Tu prueba de Garden Pro termina el <strong>%(date)s</strong>. Esto es lo "
"que pasa:"

msgid "What you keep (free forever):"
msgstr "Lo que conservas (gratis para siempre):"

msgid ""
"Garden profile, member directory, plot assignments, announcements, "
"harvest logging, basic dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Perfil del huerto, directorio de integrantes, asignación de parcelas, "
"anuncios, registro de cosechas y panel básico."

#, python-format
msgid "What locks on %(date)s:"
msgstr "Lo que se bloquea el %(date)s:"

msgid ""
"Financial management (dues, expenses, reminders), volunteer shift "
"scheduling, photo wall, broadcast messaging, custom email branding, plot "
"grid editor, data export."
msgstr ""
"Administración financiera (cuotas, gastos, recordatorios), turnos de "
"voluntariado, muro de fotos, mensajes masivos, correos con tu propia "
"marca, editor del plano de parcelas y exportación de datos."

msgid ""
"Your data is never deleted — it's all there when you're ready to "
"subscribe."
msgstr "Tus datos nunca se borran: siguen ahí para cuando decidas suscribirte."

msgid "Monthly"
msgstr "Mensual"

#, python-format
msgid "%(amount)s/month"
msgstr "%(amount)s al mes"

msgid "Annual"
msgstr "Anual"

#, python-format
msgid "%(amount)s/year"
msgstr "%(amount)s al año"

msgid "Subscribe to Garden Pro"
msgstr "Suscribirme a Garden Pro"

msgid "Your Garden Pro trial has ended"
msgstr "Tu prueba de Garden Pro terminó"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your %(days)s-day trial for <strong>%(garden)s</strong> has ended. Pro "
"features are now locked, but your garden profile, plots, members, and all"
" your data remain intact."
msgstr ""
"Tu prueba de %(days)s días de <strong>%(garden)s</strong> terminó. Las "
"funciones de Pro quedaron bloqueadas, pero el perfil del huerto, las "
"parcelas, los integrantes y todos tus datos siguen intactos."

msgid "Ready to continue? Choose your plan:"
msgstr "¿Quieres continuar? Elige tu plan:"

msgid "flexible, cancel anytime"
msgstr "flexible, cancela cuando quieras"

msgid "Subscribe Now"
msgstr "Suscribirme ahora"

msgid ""
"If you have questions about whether Garden Pro is right for your garden, "
"reply to this email. We're happy to help."
msgstr ""
"Si tienes dudas sobre si Garden Pro le conviene a tu huerto, responde a "
"este correo. Con gusto te ayudamos."

#, python-format
msgid "%(num)s member is waiting on %(garden)s"
msgid_plural "%(num)s members are waiting on %(garden)s"
msgstr[0] "%(num)s integrante está esperando %(garden)s"
msgstr[1] "%(num)s integrantes están esperando %(garden)s"

#, python-format
msgid "<strong>%(num)s member</strong>"
msgid_plural "<strong>%(num)s members</strong>"
msgstr[0] "<strong>%(num)s integrante</strong>"
msgstr[1] "<strong>%(num)s integrantes</strong>"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your garden is still active — %(members)s have access and are using the "
"platform."
msgstr ""
"Tu huerto sigue activo: %(members)s tienen acceso y están usando la "
"plataforma."

#, python-format
msgid "%(garden)s is ready when you are"
msgstr "%(garden)s está listo cuando tú lo estés"

msgid "Your garden is still active, and everything you set up is saved."
msgstr "Tu huerto sigue activo y todo lo que configuraste está guardado."

msgid "It's been a week since your Garden Pro trial ended."
msgstr "Pasó una semana desde que terminó tu prueba de Garden Pro."

msgid ""
"The Pro features (dues management, volunteer tracking, messaging) would "
"make your job as organizer a lot easier."
msgstr ""
"Las funciones de Pro (cuotas, voluntariado, mensajes) te harían mucho más"
" fácil el trabajo de organizar."

#, python-format
msgid "works out to ~%(amount)s/month"
msgstr "sale en ~%(amount)s al mes"

msgid "Reactivate Garden Pro"
msgstr "Reactivar Garden Pro"

msgid ""
"This is our last email about upgrading. We won't ask again — but the "
"option is always there in your garden settings."
msgstr ""
"Este es nuestro último correo sobre el plan Pro. No volveremos a "
"preguntar, pero la opción siempre estará en los ajustes de tu huerto."

msgid "Action needed: payment failed"
msgstr "Necesitamos tu atención: el pago falló"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"We were not able to process your Garden Pro payment for "
"<strong>%(garden)s</strong>. Your Pro features stay active for 7 days "
"while you update your payment method."
msgstr ""
"No pudimos procesar tu pago de Garden Pro de <strong>%(garden)s</strong>."
" Las funciones de Pro siguen activas 7 días mientras actualizas tu forma "
"de pago."

msgid "Update Payment Method"
msgstr "Actualizar mi forma de pago"

msgid ""
"If your payment is not updated within 7 days, your garden returns to the "
"free plan. Your data will not be deleted."
msgstr ""
"Si no se actualiza el pago en 7 días, tu huerto regresa al plan gratuito."
" Tus datos no se borrarán."

#, python-format
msgid "Action needed: payment failed for %(garden)s"
msgstr "Necesitamos tu atención: falló el pago de %(garden)s"

#, python-format
msgid "Garden Pro cancelled for %(garden)s"
msgstr "Se canceló Garden Pro de %(garden)s"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your Garden Pro subscription for <strong>%(garden)s</strong> has been "
"cancelled. You keep Pro access until <strong>%(date)s</strong>, then your"
" garden returns to the free plan."
msgstr ""
"Se canceló tu suscripción a Garden Pro de <strong>%(garden)s</strong>. "
"Conservas el acceso Pro hasta el <strong>%(date)s</strong> y después tu "
"huerto regresa al plan gratuito."

msgid ""
"Your data (plots, members, financials, harvest logs) is never deleted. "
"You can subscribe again at any time from your garden settings."
msgstr ""
"Tus datos (parcelas, integrantes, finanzas, registros de cosecha) nunca "
"se borran. Puedes volver a suscribirte cuando quieras desde los ajustes "
"de tu huerto."

msgid ""
"We would like to know what we could do better — reply to this email with "
"any feedback."
msgstr ""
"Nos gustaría saber qué podríamos hacer mejor: responde a este correo con "
"tus comentarios."

msgid "Welcome to YardHarvest"
msgstr "Bienvenido a YardHarvest"

#, python-format
msgid "<strong>%(garden)s</strong> is set up and live on YardHarvest."
msgstr ""
"<strong>%(garden)s</strong> ya está configurado y publicado en "
"YardHarvest."

msgid ""
"You are on the free plan, which includes your garden profile, member "
"directory, plot assignments, announcements, harvest logging, and the "
"basic dashboard — free forever."
msgstr ""
"Tienes el plan gratuito, que incluye el perfil del huerto, el directorio "
"de integrantes, la asignación de parcelas, los anuncios, el registro de "
"cosechas y el panel básico: gratis para siempre."

msgid "A few good first steps:"
msgstr "Unos buenos primeros pasos:"

msgid "Set up your garden layout from the dashboard"
msgstr "Arma el plano del huerto desde el panel"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"When you are ready for more — dues collection, volunteer shifts, "
"broadcast messaging, and the rest of Garden Pro — a free %(days)s-day "
"trial is waiting on your <a href=\"%(url)s\">billing page</a>. No card "
"required."
msgstr ""
"Cuando quieras más (cobro de cuotas, turnos de voluntariado, mensajes "
"masivos y el resto de Garden Pro), tienes una prueba gratuita de %(days)s"
" días en tu <a href=\"%(url)s\">página de facturación</a>. No se necesita"
" tarjeta."

#, python-format
msgid "Welcome to YardHarvest — %(garden)s is live"
msgstr "Bienvenido a YardHarvest: %(garden)s ya está publicado"

#, python-format
msgid "Start your free %(days)s-day Garden Pro trial"
msgstr "Empieza tu prueba gratuita de %(days)s días de Garden Pro"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"<strong>%(garden)s</strong> has been on YardHarvest for a couple of days "
"— a good moment to see what Garden Pro does for organizers."
msgstr ""
"<strong>%(garden)s</strong> lleva un par de días en YardHarvest: buen "
"momento para ver qué hace Garden Pro por quien organiza."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The trial unlocks everything for %(days)s days: dues collection and "
"financial tracking, volunteer shift scheduling, broadcast messaging, the "
"photo wall, custom email branding, and data export. No card required, and"
" everything you set up stays if you decide it is not for you."
msgstr ""
"La prueba desbloquea todo durante %(days)s días: cobro de cuotas y "
"seguimiento financiero, turnos de voluntariado, mensajes masivos, muro de"
" fotos, correos con tu propia marca y exportación de datos. No se "
"necesita tarjeta, y todo lo que configures se queda si decides que no es "
"para ti."

msgid "Start Your Free Trial"
msgstr "Empezar mi prueba gratuita"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Prefer to keep it simple? The free plan is not going anywhere — your "
"garden page is at <a href=\"%(url)s\">%(url)s</a>."
msgstr ""
"¿Prefieres algo sencillo? El plan gratuito no va a desaparecer: la página"
" de tu huerto está en <a href=\"%(url)s\">%(url)s</a>."

msgid "You've been assigned a plot!"
msgstr "¡Te asignaron una parcela!"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Great news — you have been assigned <strong>Plot %(plot)s</strong> at "
"<strong>%(garden)s</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Buenas noticias: te asignaron la <strong>parcela %(plot)s</strong> en "
"<strong>%(garden)s</strong>."

msgid "Here's what to do next:"
msgstr "Esto es lo que sigue:"

msgid "Visit your garden page"
msgstr "Visita la página del huerto"

msgid "Check plot details, rules, and upcoming events"
msgstr "Consulta los detalles de la parcela, las reglas y los próximos eventos"

msgid "Meet your neighbors"
msgstr "Conoce a tus vecinos"

msgid "Introduce yourself to fellow gardeners"
msgstr "Preséntate con los demás hortelanos"

msgid "Plan your season"
msgstr "Planea tu temporada"

msgid "Use the Planting Calendar for Zone 5b guidance"
msgstr "Usa el Calendario de siembra para la zona 5b"

msgid "View Your Garden"
msgstr "Ver mi huerto"

#, python-format
msgid "Plot assigned at %(garden)s"
msgstr "Te asignaron una parcela en %(garden)s"

msgid "You're on the waitlist"
msgstr "Estás en la lista de espera"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"You have been added to the waitlist for <strong>%(garden)s</strong>. Your"
" position is <strong>#%(position)s</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Te anotamos en la lista de espera de <strong>%(garden)s</strong>. Tu "
"lugar es el <strong>#%(position)s</strong>."

msgid ""
"We will let you know as soon as a plot becomes available. In the "
"meantime, you can check garden events and announcements."
msgstr ""
"Te avisaremos en cuanto se desocupe una parcela. Mientras tanto, puedes "
"ver los eventos y anuncios del huerto."

#, python-format
msgid "Waitlisted for %(garden)s"
msgstr "Lista de espera en %(garden)s"

#, python-format
msgid "Dues reminder for %(garden)s"
msgstr "Recordatorio de cuotas de %(garden)s"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"This is a friendly reminder that your <strong>%(year)s</strong> garden "
"dues of <strong>$%(amount)s</strong> are outstanding for "
"<strong>%(garden)s</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Te recordamos que tienes pendiente el pago de tus cuotas "
"<strong>%(year)s</strong> de <strong>%(garden)s</strong>: "
"<strong>$%(amount)s</strong>."

msgid "You can pay online from your garden page — it only takes a moment."
msgstr "Puedes pagarlas en línea desde la página del huerto: solo toma un momento."

msgid "Pay Dues Now"
msgstr "Pagar mis cuotas"

#, python-format
msgid "Dues reminder: %(garden)s"
msgstr "Recordatorio de cuotas: %(garden)s"

#, python-format
msgid "Upcoming shift at %(garden)s"
msgstr "Tu próximo turno en %(garden)s"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Just a reminder — you are signed up for <strong>%(shift)s</strong> at "
"<strong>%(garden)s</strong> on <strong>%(date)s</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Te recordamos que te apuntaste a <strong>%(shift)s</strong> en "
"<strong>%(garden)s</strong> el <strong>%(date)s</strong>."

#, python-format
msgid "Shift reminder: %(shift)s"
msgstr "Recordatorio de turno: %(shift)s"

msgid "Verify your new email address"
msgstr "Verifica tu nuevo correo electrónico"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"A request was made to change the email on your YardHarvest account to "
"<strong>%(email)s</strong>. Click the button below to confirm:"
msgstr ""
"Se pidió cambiar el correo de tu cuenta de YardHarvest a "
"<strong>%(email)s</strong>. Usa el botón de abajo para confirmarlo:"

msgid "Verify Email Address"
msgstr "Verificar el correo"

msgid ""
"This link expires in 24 hours and can only be used once. Your account "
"email will not change until you confirm. If you didn't request this, you "
"can safely ignore this email."
msgstr ""
"El enlace vence en 24 horas y solo se puede usar una vez. El correo de tu"
" cuenta no cambiará hasta que lo confirmes. Si no pediste esto, puedes "
"ignorar este mensaje."

msgid "Email change requested"
msgstr "Se pidió cambiar tu correo"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"A request was made to change your YardHarvest account email to "
"<strong>%(email)s</strong>. Nothing changes until that address is "
"verified."
msgstr ""
"Se pidió cambiar el correo de tu cuenta de YardHarvest a "
"<strong>%(email)s</strong>. Nada cambia hasta que se verifique esa "
"dirección."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"If this was not you, <a href=\"%(url)s\">reset your password</a> "
"immediately to secure your account."
msgstr ""
"Si no fuiste tú, <a href=\"%(url)s\">restablece tu contraseña</a> de "
"inmediato para proteger tu cuenta."

msgid "Email change requested on your account"
msgstr "Se pidió cambiar el correo de tu cuenta"

msgid "Your account email was changed"
msgstr "Se cambió el correo de tu cuenta"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The email on your YardHarvest account was changed from "
"<strong>%(old)s</strong> to <strong>%(new)s</strong>."
msgstr ""
"El correo de tu cuenta de YardHarvest cambió de <strong>%(old)s</strong> "
"a <strong>%(new)s</strong>."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"If this was not you, <a href=\"%(url)s\">reset your password</a> "
"immediately and contact support."
msgstr ""
"Si no fuiste tú, <a href=\"%(url)s\">restablece tu contraseña</a> de "
"inmediato y escríbenos."

msgid "You're signed up!"
msgstr "¡Quedaste apuntado!"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"You are confirmed for <strong>%(shift)s</strong> at "
"<strong>%(garden)s</strong> on <strong>%(date)s</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Confirmamos tu lugar en <strong>%(shift)s</strong> en "
"<strong>%(garden)s</strong> el <strong>%(date)s</strong>."

msgid ""
"If your plans change, you can cancel your signup from the garden's events"
" page."
msgstr ""
"Si tus planes cambian, puedes cancelar tu turno en la página de eventos "
"del huerto."

#, python-format
msgid "Signed up: %(shift)s"
msgstr "Te apuntaste: %(shift)s"

#, python-format
msgid "on <strong>%(date)s</strong>"
msgstr "el <strong>%(date)s</strong>"

msgid "Event cancelled"
msgstr "Evento cancelado"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"<strong>%(event)s</strong> at <strong>%(garden)s</strong>%(when)s has "
"been cancelled."
msgstr ""
"Se canceló <strong>%(event)s</strong> en "
"<strong>%(garden)s</strong>%(when)s."

msgid ""
"We are sorry for any inconvenience. Keep an eye on the garden page for "
"upcoming events."
msgstr ""
"Lamentamos el inconveniente. Revisa la página del huerto para ver los "
"próximos eventos."

#, python-format
msgid "Cancelled: %(event)s at %(garden)s"
msgstr "Cancelado: %(event)s en %(garden)s"

msgid "Full Refund Issued"
msgstr "Reembolso total realizado"

msgid "Partial Refund Issued"
msgstr "Reembolso parcial realizado"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"A full refund of <strong>$%(amount)s</strong> has been issued for your "
"order <strong>#%(order)s</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Se hizo un reembolso total de <strong>$%(amount)s</strong> de tu pedido "
"<strong>#%(order)s</strong>."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"A partial refund of <strong>$%(amount)s</strong> has been issued for your"
" order <strong>#%(order)s</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Se hizo un reembolso parcial de <strong>$%(amount)s</strong> de tu pedido"
" <strong>#%(order)s</strong>."

#, python-format
msgid "Full refund for order #%(order)s"
msgstr "Reembolso total del pedido #%(order)s"

#, python-format
msgid "Partial refund for order #%(order)s"
msgstr "Reembolso parcial del pedido #%(order)s"

msgid "Order"
msgstr "Pedido"

msgid "Original Total"
msgstr "Total original"

msgid "Refund Amount"
msgstr "Monto del reembolso"

msgid "The refund will appear on your statement within 5-10 business days."
msgstr "El reembolso aparecerá en tu estado de cuenta en 5 a 10 días hábiles."

msgid "View Order"
msgstr "Ver el pedido"

